{"id":"forecast-18","section":1,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-18/audio-1.mp3","model":"small","duration":261.62,"segments":[{"start":0.34,"end":4.08,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions one to six.","words":[["Now",0.34,0.94],["listen",0.94,1.3],["carefully",1.3,1.8],["and",1.8,2.16],["answer",2.16,2.56],["questions",2.56,3.12],["one",3.12,3.5],["to",3.5,3.72],["six.",3.72,4.08]]},{"start":7.55,"end":14.27,"text":"Hi, Altef. I'm your settlement worker and I'm called Jenny. It's great to meet you.","words":[["Hi,",7.55,8.17],["Altef.",8.41,8.87],["I'm",9.15,9.55],["your",9.55,9.69],["settlement",9.69,10.09],["worker",10.09,10.59],["and",10.59,11.33],["I'm",11.33,11.63],["called",11.63,11.85],["Jenny.",11.85,12.17],["It's",13.09,13.45],["great",13.45,13.67],["to",13.67,13.85],["meet",13.85,14.03],["you.",14.03,14.27]]},{"start":14.85,"end":17.15,"text":"Welcome to our city. You'll love Toronto.","words":[["Welcome",14.85,15.19],["to",15.19,15.45],["our",15.45,15.59],["city.",15.59,15.85],["You'll",16.27,16.51],["love",16.51,16.87],["Toronto.",16.87,17.15]]},{"start":17.87,"end":18.85,"text":"I'm sure I will.","words":[["I'm",17.87,18.15],["sure",18.15,18.41],["I",18.41,18.65],["will.",18.65,18.85]]},{"start":19.29,"end":24.01,"text":"I have some general recommendations. First, Toronto's a big place.","words":[["I",19.29,19.63],["have",19.63,19.93],["some",19.93,20.23],["general",20.23,20.75],["recommendations.",20.75,21.43],["First,",22.31,22.55],["Toronto's",22.93,23.33],["a",23.33,23.41],["big",23.41,23.59],["place.",23.59,24.01]]},{"start":24.63,"end":28.07,"text":"A lot of people who come here choose to live in the West.","words":[["A",24.63,24.87],["lot",24.87,25.07],["of",25.07,25.21],["people",25.21,25.53],["who",25.53,25.81],["come",25.81,26.13],["here",26.13,26.39],["choose",26.39,26.75],["to",26.75,27.03],["live",27.03,27.23],["in",27.23,27.51],["the",27.51,27.63],["West.",27.63,28.07]]},{"start":28.57,"end":30.73,"text":"I see. Is there a reason for that?","words":[["I",28.57,28.77],["see.",28.77,29.11],["Is",29.49,29.75],["there",29.75,29.93],["a",29.93,30.05],["reason",30.05,30.33],["for",30.33,30.57],["that?",30.57,30.73]]},{"start":30.73,"end":37.61,"text":"Well, yes. There's a great market in the neighborhood. All the local people know about it.","words":[["Well,",30.73,31.47],["yes.",31.81,32.19],["There's",32.77,33.29],["a",33.29,33.45],["great",33.45,33.79],["market",33.79,34.35],["in",34.35,34.49],["the",34.49,34.59],["neighborhood.",34.59,34.97],["All",35.63,36.07],["the",36.07,36.25],["local",36.25,36.47],["people",36.47,36.83],["know",36.83,37.09],["about",37.09,37.35],["it.",37.35,37.61]]},{"start":38.19,"end":39.91,"text":"Oh, that would be good for us.","words":[["Oh,",38.19,38.61],["that",38.65,38.85],["would",38.85,39.01],["be",39.01,39.13],["good",39.13,39.37],["for",39.37,39.61],["us.",39.61,39.91]]},{"start":40.33,"end":42.97,"text":"And I understand you have young children.","words":[["And",40.33,40.77],["I",40.77,40.97],["understand",40.97,41.53],["you",41.53,41.93],["have",41.93,42.21],["young",42.21,42.53],["children.",42.53,42.97]]},{"start":43.45,"end":44.09,"text":"That's right.","words":[["That's",43.45,43.83],["right.",43.83,44.09]]},{"start":44.83,"end":51.19,"text":"So another advantage of this area is that it has quite a few parks where children can play.","words":[["So",44.83,45.21],["another",45.21,45.71],["advantage",45.71,46.29],["of",46.29,46.59],["this",46.59,46.75],["area",46.75,47.13],["is",47.13,47.75],["that",47.75,47.93],["it",47.93,48.07],["has",48.07,48.29],["quite",48.29,48.69],["a",48.69,48.93],["few",48.93,49.19],["parks",49.19,49.73],["where",49.73,50.13],["children",50.13,50.49],["can",50.49,50.77],["play.",50.77,51.19]]},{"start":51.63,"end":54.65,"text":"Oh, that's great. They really like being outside.","words":[["Oh,",51.63,51.93],["that's",51.97,52.25],["great.",52.25,52.73],["They",53.15,53.25],["really",53.25,53.59],["like",53.59,53.87],["being",53.87,54.15],["outside.",54.15,54.65]]},{"start":55.23,"end":58.69,"text":"I actually know of an apartment in the area that's available.","words":[["I",55.23,55.65],["actually",55.65,56.21],["know",56.21,56.63],["of",56.63,56.75],["an",56.75,56.85],["apartment",56.85,57.23],["in",57.23,57.55],["the",57.55,57.67],["area",57.67,57.93],["that's",57.93,58.21],["available.",58.21,58.69]]},{"start":58.69,"end":65.43,"text":"I'll arrange for you to see it, but first let's look at the floor plan and I'll tell you what","words":[["I'll",58.69,59.71],["arrange",59.71,60.03],["for",60.03,60.31],["you",60.31,60.43],["to",60.43,60.55],["see",60.55,60.85],["it,",60.85,61.05],["but",61.39,61.69],["first",61.69,62.23],["let's",62.23,62.63],["look",62.63,62.83],["at",62.83,62.99],["the",62.99,63.09],["floor",63.09,63.49],["plan",63.49,63.99],["and",63.99,64.61],["I'll",64.61,64.81],["tell",64.81,65.01],["you",65.01,65.23],["what",65.23,65.43]]},{"start":65.43,"end":67.01,"text":"to check when you see it.","words":[["to",65.43,65.61],["check",65.61,65.97],["when",65.97,66.37],["you",66.37,66.55],["see",66.55,66.79],["it.",66.79,67.01]]},{"start":67.84,"end":70.11,"text":"This room here is the kitchen.","words":[["This",67.84,68.15],["room",68.15,68.49],["here",68.49,69.01],["is",69.01,69.67],["the",69.67,69.83],["kitchen.",69.83,70.11]]},{"start":70.79,"end":72.71,"text":"Be sure to open the refrigerator.","words":[["Be",70.79,71.07],["sure",71.07,71.49],["to",71.49,71.67],["open",71.67,72.03],["the",72.03,72.23],["refrigerator.",72.23,72.71]]},{"start":73.43,"end":74.97,"text":"To see if it's working properly.","words":[["To",73.43,73.75],["see",73.75,74.03],["if",74.03,74.15],["it's",74.15,74.31],["working",74.31,74.61],["properly.",74.61,74.97]]},{"start":75.31,"end":79.15,"text":"Yes, and to make sure that there's no nasty smell.","words":[["Yes,",75.31,75.85],["and",76.17,76.35],["to",76.35,76.53],["make",76.53,76.71],["sure",76.71,77.07],["that",77.07,77.43],["there's",77.43,77.89],["no",77.89,78.09],["nasty",78.09,78.69],["smell.",78.69,79.15]]},{"start":79.81,"end":81.41,"text":"Oh, anything else?","words":[["Oh,",79.81,80.07],["anything",80.69,81.09],["else?",81.09,81.41]]},{"start":81.79,"end":85.07,"text":"Well, it would be good to check the electrical situation.","words":[["Well,",81.79,82.17],["it",82.41,82.59],["would",82.59,82.73],["be",82.73,82.87],["good",82.87,83.09],["to",83.09,83.25],["check",83.25,83.51],["the",83.51,83.73],["electrical",83.73,84.33],["situation.",84.33,85.07]]},{"start":85.07,"end":90.05,"text":"There's nothing worse than not having enough plugs. You'll need at least four.","words":[["There's",85.07,86.01],["nothing",86.01,86.31],["worse",86.31,86.67],["than",86.67,86.89],["not",86.89,87.09],["having",87.09,87.37],["enough",87.37,87.61],["plugs.",87.61,88.03],["You'll",88.49,88.93],["need",88.93,89.07],["at",89.07,89.23],["least",89.23,89.47],["four.",89.47,90.05]]},{"start":90.55,"end":94.09,"text":"I'll look for those. Um, what's this on the plan?","words":[["I'll",90.55,91.05],["look",91.05,91.23],["for",91.23,91.39],["those.",91.39,91.65],["Um,",92.21,92.51],["what's",92.71,93.05],["this",93.05,93.39],["on",93.39,93.69],["the",93.69,93.79],["plan?",93.79,94.09]]},{"start":94.51,"end":100.75,"text":"Well, now that's the living room. And this is where you go outside to a small balcony.","words":[["Well,",94.51,94.83],["now",94.89,95.29],["that's",95.29,95.89],["the",95.89,96.03],["living",96.03,96.21],["room.",96.21,96.57],["And",97.07,97.53],["this",97.53,97.85],["is",97.85,98.13],["where",98.13,98.43],["you",98.43,98.65],["go",98.65,98.83],["outside",98.83,99.47],["to",99.47,99.77],["a",99.77,99.97],["small",99.97,100.25],["balcony.",100.25,100.75]]},{"start":101.81,"end":104.89,"text":"Have a look at the door lock. Be sure it's not broken.","words":[["Have",101.81,102.13],["a",102.13,102.29],["look",102.29,102.51],["at",102.51,102.73],["the",102.73,102.83],["door",102.83,103.15],["lock.",103.15,103.47],["Be",103.85,103.99],["sure",103.99,104.23],["it's",104.23,104.39],["not",104.39,104.51],["broken.",104.51,104.89]]},{"start":105.39,"end":109.55,"text":"I will. It'll be nice to have our own place to sit outside when we want.","words":[["I",105.39,105.61],["will.",105.61,105.85],["It'll",106.45,106.75],["be",106.75,106.89],["nice",106.89,107.17],["to",107.17,107.35],["have",107.35,107.47],["our",107.47,107.67],["own",107.67,107.83],["place",107.83,108.07],["to",108.07,108.31],["sit",108.31,108.45],["outside",108.45,108.83],["when",108.83,109.17],["we",109.17,109.31],["want.",109.31,109.55]]},{"start":109.55,"end":113.19,"text":"Yes, it's very nice on a summer evening after dinner.","words":[["Yes,",109.55,110.23],["it's",110.55,110.81],["very",110.81,111.07],["nice",111.07,111.39],["on",111.39,111.75],["a",111.75,111.87],["summer",111.87,112.13],["evening",112.13,112.55],["after",112.55,112.89],["dinner.",112.89,113.19]]},{"start":113.93,"end":117.41,"text":"And, Altef, have a good look around the living room.","words":[["And,",113.93,114.27],["Altef,",114.39,114.87],["have",115.19,115.49],["a",115.49,115.71],["good",115.71,115.91],["look",115.91,116.15],["around",116.15,116.63],["the",116.63,116.95],["living",116.95,117.11],["room.",117.11,117.41]]},{"start":118.11,"end":122.07,"text":"The condition of the room is important because it's your main living area.","words":[["The",118.11,118.33],["condition",118.33,118.83],["of",118.83,119.07],["the",119.07,119.19],["room",119.19,119.45],["is",119.45,119.69],["important",119.69,120.27],["because",120.27,120.65],["it's",120.65,120.99],["your",120.99,121.13],["main",121.13,121.33],["living",121.33,121.65],["area.",121.65,122.07]]},{"start":122.81,"end":127.33,"text":"Look at the paint in particular. It may be time to redo it.","words":[["Look",122.81,123.19],["at",123.19,123.35],["the",123.35,123.45],["paint",123.45,123.83],["in",123.83,124.15],["particular.",124.15,124.57],["It",125.43,125.69],["may",125.69,125.93],["be",125.93,126.17],["time",126.17,126.49],["to",126.49,126.69],["redo",126.69,126.99],["it.",126.99,127.33]]},{"start":127.81,"end":128.71,"text":"I'll check that.","words":[["I'll",127.81,128.15],["check",128.15,128.37],["that.",128.37,128.71]]},{"start":132.14,"end":138.1,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions 7 to 10.","words":[["Before",132.14,132.6],["you",132.6,132.86],["hear",132.86,133.12],["the",133.12,133.32],["rest",133.32,133.56],["of",133.56,133.7],["the",133.7,133.8],["conversation,",133.8,134.36],["you",135.02,135.34],["have",135.34,135.52],["some",135.52,135.7],["time",135.7,136.14],["to",136.14,136.4],["look",136.4,136.56],["at",136.56,136.68],["questions",136.68,137.04],["7",137.04,137.54],["to",137.54,137.8],["10.",137.8,138.1]]},{"start":138.1,"end":161.56,"text":"Now listen and answer questions seven to ten.","words":[["Now",138.1,139.06],["listen",158.74,159.0],["and",159.0,159.48],["answer",159.48,159.92],["questions",159.92,160.3],["seven",160.3,160.94],["to",160.94,161.2],["ten.",161.2,161.56]]},{"start":164.84,"end":168.9,"text":"Now, Altaf, this hall leads to the bathroom.","words":[["Now,",164.84,165.48],["Altaf,",165.86,166.52],["this",166.94,167.26],["hall",167.26,167.68],["leads",167.68,168.16],["to",168.16,168.4],["the",168.4,168.52],["bathroom.",168.52,168.9]]},{"start":169.76,"end":173.12,"text":"When you look at that, do check below the sink.","words":[["When",169.76,170.32],["you",170.32,170.52],["look",170.52,170.7],["at",170.7,170.9],["that,",170.9,171.12],["do",171.38,171.7],["check",171.7,172.08],["below",172.08,172.48],["the",172.48,172.82],["sink.",172.82,173.12]]},{"start":173.78,"end":176.1,"text":"Often that's the place you'll find a leak.","words":[["Often",173.78,174.4],["that's",174.4,174.78],["the",174.78,174.86],["place",174.86,175.12],["you'll",175.12,175.46],["find",175.46,175.64],["a",175.64,175.88],["leak.",175.88,176.1]]},{"start":176.76,"end":179.86,"text":"And the tiles in the bathroom should be in good shape.","words":[["And",176.76,177.22],["the",177.22,177.38],["tiles",177.38,177.86],["in",177.86,178.14],["the",178.14,178.24],["bathroom",178.24,178.7],["should",178.7,179.02],["be",179.02,179.22],["in",179.22,179.34],["good",179.34,179.5],["shape.",179.5,179.86]]},{"start":180.36,"end":184.42,"text":"I agree. Then this room must be one of the bedrooms.","words":[["I",180.36,180.62],["agree.",180.62,180.98],["Then",181.78,182.1],["this",182.1,182.58],["room",182.58,182.98],["must",182.98,183.4],["be",183.4,183.66],["one",183.66,183.88],["of",183.88,183.98],["the",183.98,184.1],["bedrooms.",184.1,184.42]]},{"start":185.02,"end":188.5,"text":"And this must be the closet. My wife wants a large one.","words":[["And",185.02,185.36],["this",185.36,185.6],["must",185.6,185.8],["be",185.8,186.04],["the",186.04,186.18],["closet.",186.18,186.66],["My",187.04,187.22],["wife",187.22,187.5],["wants",187.5,187.84],["a",187.84,188.02],["large",188.02,188.26],["one.",188.26,188.5]]},{"start":188.5,"end":192.98,"text":"I'm sure. We all want lots of room for our clothes.","words":[["I'm",188.5,189.04],["sure.",189.04,189.42],["We",190.1,190.6],["all",190.6,190.94],["want",190.94,191.22],["lots",191.22,191.52],["of",191.52,191.82],["room",191.82,192.18],["for",192.18,192.42],["our",192.42,192.56],["clothes.",192.56,192.98]]},{"start":193.88,"end":196.96,"text":"You'll also want to look outside the bedroom window.","words":[["You'll",193.88,194.24],["also",194.24,194.64],["want",194.64,194.98],["to",194.98,195.22],["look",195.22,195.34],["outside",195.34,195.94],["the",195.94,196.2],["bedroom",196.2,196.5],["window.",196.5,196.96]]},{"start":197.62,"end":202.92,"text":"It overlooks the street and there might be a lot of noise at all times of the day and night.","words":[["It",197.62,197.82],["overlooks",197.82,198.46],["the",198.46,198.56],["street",198.56,198.92],["and",198.92,199.5],["there",199.5,199.7],["might",199.7,199.9],["be",199.9,200.12],["a",200.12,200.24],["lot",200.24,200.48],["of",200.48,200.64],["noise",200.64,201.04],["at",201.04,201.32],["all",201.32,201.56],["times",201.56,201.9],["of",201.9,202.12],["the",202.12,202.2],["day",202.2,202.5],["and",202.5,202.64],["night.",202.64,202.92]]},{"start":203.36,"end":205.24,"text":"We're in a very busy city.","words":[["We're",203.36,203.82],["in",203.82,204.02],["a",204.02,204.14],["very",204.14,204.4],["busy",204.4,204.82],["city.",204.82,205.24]]},{"start":205.78,"end":209.9,"text":"I see. That would be a problem for my wife and the boys too.","words":[["I",205.78,205.98],["see.",205.98,206.32],["That",206.9,207.22],["would",207.22,207.4],["be",207.4,207.58],["a",207.58,207.7],["problem",207.7,208.04],["for",208.04,208.26],["my",208.26,208.48],["wife",208.48,208.8],["and",208.8,209.08],["the",209.08,209.22],["boys",209.22,209.52],["too.",209.52,209.9]]},{"start":210.54,"end":212.36,"text":"I'll definitely remember to check that.","words":[["I'll",210.54,210.86],["definitely",210.86,211.22],["remember",211.22,211.62],["to",211.62,211.86],["check",211.86,212.1],["that.",212.1,212.36]]},{"start":213.26,"end":215.3,"text":"Jenny, what other things are in the building?","words":[["Jenny,",213.26,213.8],["what",214.02,214.16],["other",214.16,214.38],["things",214.38,214.64],["are",214.64,214.82],["in",214.82,214.94],["the",214.94,215.04],["building?",215.04,215.3]]},{"start":215.82,"end":217.08,"text":"You mean the facilities?","words":[["You",215.82,216.16],["mean",216.16,216.42],["the",216.42,216.72],["facilities?",216.72,217.08]]},{"start":217.08,"end":220.74,"text":"Yes. For example, where will we do our laundry?","words":[["Yes.",217.08,217.94],["For",218.36,218.58],["example,",218.58,218.98],["where",219.22,219.46],["will",219.46,219.68],["we",219.68,219.86],["do",219.86,220.06],["our",220.06,220.24],["laundry?",220.24,220.74]]},{"start":221.72,"end":227.04,"text":"With a building of this type, it's probably in the basement, but it doesn't say.","words":[["With",221.72,222.06],["a",222.06,222.26],["building",222.26,222.56],["of",222.56,222.78],["this",222.78,223.0],["type,",223.0,223.38],["it's",223.58,223.92],["probably",223.92,224.54],["in",224.54,225.14],["the",225.14,225.24],["basement,",225.24,225.66],["but",225.96,226.32],["it",226.32,226.46],["doesn't",226.46,226.72],["say.",226.72,227.04]]},{"start":227.52,"end":229.7,"text":"So you'll need to check where it is.","words":[["So",227.52,227.92],["you'll",227.92,228.36],["need",228.36,228.54],["to",228.54,228.72],["check",228.72,229.0],["where",229.0,229.24],["it",229.24,229.42],["is.",229.42,229.7]]},{"start":230.58,"end":233.14,"text":"You know what's also really good to check for?","words":[["You",230.58,230.74],["know",230.74,230.94],["what's",230.94,231.34],["also",231.34,231.82],["really",231.82,232.22],["good",232.22,232.46],["to",232.46,232.6],["check",232.6,232.84],["for?",232.84,233.14]]},{"start":233.78,"end":234.54,"text":"Know what?","words":[["Know",233.78,234.22],["what?",234.22,234.54]]},{"start":234.96,"end":238.94,"text":"You need to check that there's a garbage room on every floor.","words":[["You",234.96,235.28],["need",235.28,235.56],["to",235.56,235.76],["check",235.76,236.1],["that",236.1,236.3],["there's",236.3,236.66],["a",236.66,236.82],["garbage",236.82,237.24],["room",237.24,237.76],["on",237.76,238.06],["every",238.06,238.5],["floor.",238.5,238.94]]},{"start":239.36,"end":240.96,"text":"Then you don't need to go outside.","words":[["Then",239.36,239.84],["you",239.84,240.02],["don't",240.02,240.18],["need",240.18,240.34],["to",240.34,240.46],["go",240.46,240.56],["outside.",240.56,240.96]]},{"start":241.44,"end":241.86,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",241.44,241.86]]},{"start":242.42,"end":244.06,"text":"Well, that's everything for now.","words":[["Well,",242.42,242.8],["that's",242.94,243.22],["everything",243.22,243.52],["for",243.52,243.8],["now.",243.8,244.06]]},{"start":244.66,"end":245.86,"text":"Good luck, Altuff.","words":[["Good",244.66,245.08],["luck,",245.08,245.3],["Altuff.",245.48,245.86]]},{"start":245.86,"end":247.66,"text":"We'll talk later today.","words":[["We'll",245.86,246.8],["talk",246.8,247.0],["later",247.0,247.3],["today.",247.3,247.66]]},{"start":248.14,"end":249.46,"text":"Thanks for your help, Jenny.","words":[["Thanks",248.14,248.58],["for",248.58,248.82],["your",248.82,248.92],["help,",248.92,249.16],["Jenny.",249.22,249.46]]},{"start":252.96,"end":254.7,"text":"That is the end of Part 1.","words":[["That",252.96,253.34],["is",253.34,253.48],["the",253.48,253.62],["end",253.62,253.96],["of",253.96,254.14],["Part",254.14,254.32],["1.",254.32,254.7]]},{"start":255.56,"end":259.32,"text":"You now have one minute to check your answers to Part 1.","words":[["You",255.56,255.78],["now",255.78,256.04],["have",256.04,256.38],["one",256.38,256.68],["minute",256.68,257.12],["to",257.12,257.44],["check",257.44,257.74],["your",257.74,258.0],["answers",258.0,258.46],["to",258.46,258.72],["Part",258.72,258.92],["1.",258.92,259.32]]}]}